      "side": 1,
      "message": "The Lid switch is an immediate hardware interrupt, but Backlight OFF is a software behavior. This creates a 0.5~1s delay. During this window, the screen is already physically touching the keyboard. If we don\u0027t use the Lid interrupt to kill touch reporting immediately, it could generate a massive amount of ghost touches, which can break the OS suspend flow.",
      "parentUuid": "7a5a0ef2_ed6d1573",
